# 13. Stage D — Model Stability

Compute the outcomes separately by model family.

Never pool first.

For each domain:

```text
             Semantic   Pairwise

Qwen           .86        .78
Mistral        .82        .73
Gemma          .84        .71
Nemotron       .79        .76
Model E        .87        .69
```

Then report:

```text
mean
variance
worst-family
range
```

Define:

[
Stability(d)
============

1-\operatorname{NormStdDev}
(\text{family outcome})
]

but keep the raw per-family results visible.

The decision policy can penalize:

```text
