# 31. Definition of done

The coding agent should not declare success until this exact command path works:

```text
1. User supplies product intent.

2. User sets:
   purchase <= $20
   renewal <= $30
   premium=false.

3. System generates heterogeneous names.

4. name.com returns real/test purchasable inventory
   and prices.

5. Constraint engine removes infeasible names.

6. Semantic inversion evaluates remaining names.

7. Multi-family pairwise arena ranks finalists.

8. System exposes disagreement/stability.

9. System recommends one domain with evidence.

10. User approves.

11. Domain is rechecked.

12. Domain is registered through name.com sandbox.

13. DNS TXT receipt is created.

14. DNS record is fetched back from name.com.

15. Final receipt displays:
    intent hash
    experiment ID
    domain
    price
    model panel
    evidence vector
    registration status
    DNS receipt.
```

If that works beautifully, stop adding features.

